{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265930/extras/fa053dbffbb75731777aa8c2268b9862.poster.avif?t=1748420948\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265930/extras/fa053dbffbb75731777aa8c2268b9862.webm?t=1748420948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265930/extras/fa053dbffbb75731777aa8c2268b9862.mp4?t=1748420948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Life is Strange: Before the Storm returns with remastered visuals across characters &amp; environments.<br><br>Set three years before \u2018Life is Strange\u2019, you play as sixteen-year old Chloe Price who forms an unlikely friendship with Rachel Amber, a beautiful and popular girl destined for success.<br><br>When Rachel learns a secret about her family that threatens to destroy her world, it is her newfound friendship with Chloe that gives her the strength to carry on.<br>No longer alone the girls must confront each other's demons and together, find a way to overcome them.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265930/extras/7a0caad0ada84f96185558964ef50f75.poster.avif?t=1748420948\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265930/extras/7a0caad0ada84f96185558964ef50f75.webm?t=1748420948\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1265930/extras/7a0caad0ada84f96185558964ef50f75.mp4?t=1748420948\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"b4f198277eff5f026ce16e0b3aad6c5576846db8.jpg","localized_name":"Recreational Vandalism","name":"Recreation